OL,3,GNEWSATinie Tempah to visit Scunthorpe
OL,4,Aafter campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rapper Tinie Tempah has confirmed
OL,7,Fhe will visit Scunthorpe, after an
OL,8,Fonline campaign was started by a local
OL,9,Ffan to get him to the town.
OL,11,FHis 2010 number one hit Pass Out
OL,12,Fincluded the lyrics "I been Southampton
OL,13,Fbut I've never been to Scunthorpe".
OL,15,FIn a video on social media, he said: "I
OL,16,Fcan't wait to come down to Scunny, and
OL,17,Fmeet the wonderful people. It's been
OL,18,Flong overdue, see you soon guys."
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
